WBMatrix-GFNI
GFNI-accelerated fixed-size matrix and affine operations over GF(2).

This software incorporates WBMatrix from Nexus-TYF/WBMatrix,
upstream commit 0043eb53e4ee1d7641c06c0155b5f2357bce18e9,
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes in this release: the matrix and affine implementation was partitioned
into dedicated source files and selected implementations were replaced by GFNI
and SIMD kernels. HBUP invertible-pair generation and M8 fixed-exponent
inversion were added. The original public headers are unchanged. WBMatrix.c
and random.c differ from the upstream versions. See provenance/README.md for
file-level attribution and the unchanged release-snapshot hashes.

The WBMatrix-GFNI release packaging, documentation and build integration were
prepared in 2026. The library snapshot itself is the validated 2026-08-21 release.
